@startuml Subagent Architecture
title Agentforce Subagent Workflow Architecture

actor Customer
participant MainAgent as "Main Agentforce Agent"
participant Router as "Intent Router"
participant QuoteSub as "QuoteGeneration Subagent"
participant ComboSub as "ComboPackage Subagent"
participant OrderSub as "OrderSupport Subagent"
participant ProductSub as "ProductRecommendation Subagent"
participant HumanHandoff as "Human Agent Handoff"

== Intent Classification ==
Customer -> MainAgent: "I need help with my order"
MainAgent -> Router: Classify intent + extract entities
Router -> Router: Analyze message context

alt Quote-related intent
    Router -> QuoteSub: Delegate to Quote Subagent
    note right: Triggers: "quote", "pricing", "discount", "proposal"
else Combo Package intent
    Router -> ComboSub: Delegate to Combo Subagent
    note right: Triggers: "bundle", "package", "combo", "kit"
else Order Support intent
    Router -> OrderSub: Delegate to Order Subagent
    note right: Triggers: "order", "tracking", "status", "return"
else Product intent
    Router -> ProductSub: Delegate to Product Subagent
    note right: Triggers: "product", "recommend", "buy", "compare"
end

== Subagent Processing ==

QuoteSub -> QuoteSub: Access specialized knowledge
note right: Quote Subagent Capabilities:
- Generate TALEXO_Quote__c
- Calculate bulk discounts
- Apply AI scoring
- Handle negotiation workflow

QuoteSub -> MainAgent: Quote generated + summary
MainAgent -> Customer: "Your quote is ready! Total: $X with Y% discount"

ComboSub -> ComboSub: Combo package expertise
note right: Combo Subagent Capabilities:
- Access ComboPackage__c data
- Compare packages
- Calculate savings
- Recommend based on needs

ComboSub -> MainAgent: Package recommendations
MainAgent -> Customer: "Best match: Computing Bundle - saves you $200"

OrderSub -> OrderSub: Order management logic
note right: Order Subagent Capabilities:
- Track Order__c status
- Handle returns/refunds
- Update shipping info
- Process cancellations

OrderSub -> MainAgent: Order status update
MainAgent -> Customer: "Your order #1234 shipped yesterday"

ProductSub -> ProductSub: Product intelligence
note right: Product Subagent Capabilities:
- Real-time inventory
- Cross-sell recommendations
- Compare products
- Price optimization

ProductSub -> MainAgent: Product suggestions
MainAgent -> Customer: "You might also like our extended warranty"

== Escalation Logic ==
note over MainAgent
    **Escalation Triggers:**
    - Customer frustration detected
    - Complex technical issues
    - High-value transactions (>$5K)
    - Subagent confidence < 70%
    - Customer requests human help
end note

MainAgent -> MainAgent: Evaluate escalation criteria

alt Needs human assistance
    MainAgent -> HumanHandoff: Transfer with full context
    HumanHandoff -> Customer: "Let me connect you with a specialist"
else Subagent can handle
    MainAgent -> Customer: Continue automated assistance
end

== Context Preservation ==
note over Router, HumanHandoff
    **Context Handover Includes:**
    - Full conversation history
    - Customer profile data
    - Current intent + entities
    - Subagent recommendations
    - Sentiment analysis
    - Session metadata
end note

== Performance Monitoring ==
Router -> Router: Track subagent performance
note right: Metrics: success rate, response time,\ncustomer satisfaction, escalation rate

Router -> MainAgent: Performance insights
MainAgent -> MainAgent: Optimize routing logic
@enduml